        "text": "41.1"
      },
      {
        "y": 71.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 399.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Are these statements about the texts true or false? Explain why."
      },
      {
        "y": 88,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 379.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 A lobbied MP has to do what his or her constituents request."
      },
      {
        "y": 100,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 443.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 MPs make a statement in the Commons about all the petitions they receive."
      },
      {
        "y": 112,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 436.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 You can read Hansard to find out what has been happening in Parliament."
      },
      {
        "y": 124,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 445.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 Government departments should comment on all the petitions they receive."
      },
      {
        "y": 136,
        "x0": 116.2,
